                            <h1 class="blog-heading-css">What are Some Tips for Succeeding in a Digital Marketing Course?
                            </h1>
                            <div class="posted-by">
                                <div class="posted-logo">
                                    <img src="../images/logo.webp" alt="King of Digital Marketing Logo" />
                                </div>
                                <div class="posted-details">
                                    <span class="posted-author">By <a class="post-font" href="https://www.kingofdigitalmarketing.com/">King of Digital Marketing</a> on June 10, 2023</span>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <a href="#"><img src="img/What are Some Tips for Succeeding in a Digital Marketing Course.webp" class="img-responsive" alt="Role Of Voice Search SEO" /></a><br>
                            <div class="cus-bullet">
